down the chimney?

803
00:31:51,110 --> 00:31:52,412
Are you kidding?

804
00:31:52,445 --> 00:31:53,747
If it keep one kid
from getting hurt,

805
00:31:53,780 --> 00:31:56,015
I'll climb up to the
top of the city hall

806
00:31:56,048 --> 00:31:57,017
and dump that bomb down.

807
00:31:57,050 --> 00:31:58,483
Yes or no?

808
00:31:58,517 --> 00:31:59,785
Hey, you know, that really
sounds great but, uh,

809
00:31:59,818 --> 00:32:02,355
we're talking about a
well-armed place here.

810
00:32:03,355 --> 00:32:05,023
Can you do this job or not?

811
00:32:05,057 --> 00:32:06,692
Well, how many
guards are there?

812
00:32:06,725 --> 00:32:08,127
Just two.

813
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:09,728
See, just two at the gate.

814
00:32:09,762 --> 00:32:10,897
I don't know.

815
00:32:10,930 --> 00:32:13,667
There must be more guards
inside those buildings.

816
00:32:13,700 --> 00:32:15,702
It would sure help to
keep those guards' attention

817
00:32:15,735 --> 00:32:16,970
