819
00:32:19,005 --> 00:32:22,508
What a great idea,
Miss Max Fly.

820
00:32:23,108 --> 00:32:24,543
Her name's Maria.

821
00:32:24,877 --> 00:32:26,512
She could keep
the guards' attention

822
00:32:26,545 --> 00:32:27,713
away from the roof
of the building.

823
00:32:27,747 --> 00:32:29,048
She'll help us.

824
00:32:29,082 --> 00:32:30,148
She's an ex-junkie.

825
00:32:30,182 --> 00:32:31,717
