That's why they shoot
her in mall parking lots.

830
00:32:39,125 --> 00:32:40,493
You're so beautiful.

831
00:32:40,527 --> 00:32:42,062
She's bouncing on
Alan Hale's stomach.

832
00:32:42,095 --> 00:32:43,863
Move to your left,
just a little bit.

833
00:32:43,897 --> 00:32:44,830
Great, great!

834
00:32:44,863 --> 00:32:46,032
Lemme see, shake your head out,

835
00:32:46,065 --> 00:32:46,698
shake your head.

836
00:32:46,732 --> 00:32:48,200
Hi, teach!

837
00:32:48,233 --> 00:32:49,802
Oh, hello Trish.

838
00:32:49,835 --> 00:32:51,037
How are you today?

839
00:32:51,070 --> 00:32:52,472
No school, I'm cool.

840
00:32:52,505 --> 00:32:54,840
Hey teach, is that
Michelle Wilson?

841
00:32:54,873 --> 00:32:55,808
She sucks.

842
00:32:55,842 --> 00:32:57,610
Uh, yes it is, excuse us.

843
00:32:59,745 --> 00:33:03,615
She rejected me, I'm
gonna go use drugs.

844
00:33:06,285 --> 00:33:07,687
We will, like, bury you.

845
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:09,488
I wonder where Maria is.

846
00:33:09,522 --> 00:33:10,757
Singing with the Von Trapp's.

847
00:33:10,790 --> 00:33:13,092
Terri, are you sure
we can trust her?

848
00:33:14,060 --> 00:33:17,297
I'm positive, look, you
girls gotta learn how-

849
00:33:17,330 --> 00:33:18,130
Hi, everybody.

850
00:33:18,163 --> 00:33:18,865
I trust her.

851
00:33:18,898 --> 00:33:19,665
(chuckles)

852
00:33:19,698 --> 00:33:20,833
See?

853
00:33:21,933 --> 00:33:24,803
This is Elaine Brenner,
she's a friend of mine.

854
00:33:24,837 --> 00:33:26,105
She helped me when I needed her,

855
00:33:26,138 --> 00:33:28,640
and boy, we could
sure use her help now.

856
00:33:28,708 --> 00:33:30,510
She's flat, but I
think we can trust her.

857
00:33:30,510 --> 00:33:31,810
Maria told me about your plan.

858
00:33:32,912 --> 00:33:34,613
I think it might be successful.

859
00:33:34,647 --> 00:33:36,048
I interrupted my
perm to come here.

860
00:33:36,115 --> 00:33:37,817
It'd be worth the attempt.

861
00:33:37,850 --> 00:33:39,218
I don't think we
really need your help.

862
00:33:39,218 --> 00:33:40,787
Let's listen to her, Terri.

863
00:33:40,820 --> 00:33:42,222
Maria told me about this.

864
00:33:42,255 --> 00:33:43,622
I've been guarding
the one potato two

865
00:33:43,655 --> 00:33:45,525
for about a week now.

866
00:33:45,925 --> 00:33:47,527
You're April, right?

867
00:33:47,560 --> 00:33:48,660
What's your plan?

868
00:33:48,693 --> 00:33:50,028
Who's your daddy?

869
00:33:50,062 --> 00:33:51,630
We're gonna drop a
bomb down the chimney

870
00:33:51,663 --> 00:33:52,532
of that building.

871
00:33:52,565 --> 00:33:53,867
And then drugs will be gone.

872
00:33:53,900 --> 00:33:56,435
That's a nice idea,
but it's not a plan.

873
00:33:56,468 --> 00:33:58,003
I mis-emphasize words.

874
00:33:58,037 --> 00:33:59,372
Where's this compound located?

875
00:33:59,405 --> 00:34:01,273
When the time comes, I'll
show you all where it is.

876
00:34:01,307 --> 00:34:03,843
If that's the way you
want it, that's alright.

877
00:34:05,143 --> 00:34:07,880
Now let's assume that these--

878
00:34:07,913 --> 00:34:08,882
Are baked beans.

879
00:34:08,915 --> 00:34:10,382
are the three buildings.

880
00:34:10,417 --> 00:34:12,017
Watch the lady,
watch the lady.

881
00:34:12,050 --> 00:34:13,185
This is our target,

882
00:34:13,218 --> 00:34:14,520
Don't spill my fish balls.

883
00:34:15,488 --> 00:34:18,858
and this is the main gate.

884
00:34:18,892 --> 00:34:20,058
Okay.

885
00:34:20,092 --> 00:34:21,993
Maria gets the
guard's attention, here.

886
00:34:22,027 --> 00:34:22,995
You, shine your love.

887
00:34:23,028 --> 00:34:25,498
April and Keiko,

888
00:34:25,532 --> 00:34:28,600
cut through the wire and get
to the roof of this building.

889
00:34:28,633 --> 00:34:29,468
Who here speaks German?

890
00:34:29,502 --> 00:34:31,803
Michelle, Terri and myself--

891
00:34:31,837 --> 00:34:32,872
Shave our heads
and get to Brussels.

892
00:34:32,905 --> 00:34:35,007
Bust through the main gate.

893
00:34:35,040 --> 00:34:37,042
We'll need a heavy
duty van or a truck

894
00:34:37,075 --> 00:34:38,443
to hit that gate.

895
00:34:38,477 --> 00:34:40,480
That's no problem,
I'll buy us anything we need.

896
00:34:40,513 --> 00:34:41,847
And I can fix up a
van so it'll blast

897
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:44,617
