will be able to stop us.

898
00:34:44,650 --> 00:34:46,885
Alright, I think it's great!

899
00:34:46,918 --> 00:34:47,953
Kill her.

900
00:34:47,987 --> 00:34:49,455
Trish, what are
you doing here?!

901
00:34:49,488 --> 00:34:51,023
Well, I heard you ask
Maria for help and--

902
00:34:51,057 --> 00:34:52,792
This is no place for a kid.

903
00:34:52,825 --> 00:34:53,993
I can help.

904
00:34:54,027 --> 00:34:55,360
And it's extra credit.

905
