Besides, I know what you
guys are planning to do and--

906
00:34:58,230 --> 00:35:00,767
Are you trying
to blackmail us?

907
00:35:00,800 --> 00:35:02,868
No, but I can
help around here.

908
00:35:02,902 --> 00:35:05,638
ook, look, I'll put things away,

909
00:35:05,672 --> 00:35:07,773
and I can help with the meals.

910
00:35:07,807 --> 00:35:10,543
(laughs)

911
00:35:10,577 --> 00:35:13,012
Suddenly I'm
thirsty for a Seven.

912
00:35:13,813 --> 00:35:15,347
So what do you think?

913
00:35:15,380 --> 00:35:16,648
Not enough deep shag.

914
00:35:16,682 --> 00:35:17,883
I don't know.

915
00:35:17,917 --> 00:35:19,385
This happened on
Designing Women once.

916
00:35:19,418 --> 00:35:20,687
What do you think, Terri?

917
00:35:21,253 --> 00:35:22,188
Hey, don't worry.

918
00:35:22,222 --> 00:35:23,055
When I get through
with this thing,

919
00:35:23,088 --> 00:35:24,223
it'll be fantastic.

920
00:35:24,257 --> 00:35:26,325
Right on, Willona.

921
00:35:26,358 --> 00:35:29,995
Well, howdy girls, shall
I gasoline her up for ya?

922
00:35:30,028 --> 00:35:34,000
Well, mercy mercy
says Mrs. Percy.

923
00:35:34,033 --> 00:35:37,370
You girls are as pretty as
a creek full of catfish.

924
00:35:37,403 --> 00:35:39,838
Oh, it's that old
bastard from the TV.

925
00:35:39,872 --> 00:35:41,840
You need this van.

926
00:35:41,873 --> 00:35:45,878
I can make you a deal as sure
as a goose goes barefooted.

927
00:35:45,912 --> 00:35:49,282
Now all you gotta do is
put a little down payment,

928
00:35:49,315 --> 00:35:56,388
and the paltry sum of
$12,673.88,

929
