it's all yours.

930
00:35:57,490 --> 00:35:59,025
Just as it stands.

931
00:35:59,058 --> 00:36:03,695
Well, maybe we could
make a deal about the $73.

932
00:36:03,728 --> 00:36:06,298
Hey, you're the pick of the
litter, did you know that?

933
00:36:07,900 --> 00:36:10,368
Then how about the 88 cents?

934
00:36:10,402 --> 00:36:12,037
Ow, my artificial hip!

935
00:36:12,070 --> 00:36:12,838
Hey, hold it there.

936
00:36:12,872 --> 00:36:14,107
Hi-Ya!

937
00:36:14,140 --> 00:36:17,443
You girls sure
do cover a vehicle.

938
00:36:17,477 --> 00:36:19,878
You jump around,
it's like a rooster

939
00:36:19,912 --> 00:36:21,480
going through a henhouse.

940
00:36:21,513 --> 00:36:23,883
Never mind about the
trading stamp's tax,

941
00:36:23,917 --> 00:36:26,285
just mail the title to
the address on the check.

942
00:36:26,318 --> 00:36:27,887
Alright, it's ours.

943
00:36:27,920 --> 00:36:29,022
Let's go, girls.

944
00:36:29,055 --> 00:36:30,488
The check.

945
00:36:30,522 --> 00:36:32,625
Wait, I've got more
barnyard analogies.

946
00:36:32,658 --> 00:36:34,127
Hold it there, the check!

947
00:36:34,160 --> 00:36:35,862
Uh, wait, girls!

948
00:36:35,895 --> 00:36:37,363
I have to circle
your phone number

949
00:36:37,397 --> 00:36:38,830
before you can leave.

950
00:36:38,863 --> 00:36:40,298
Hey, it has to be verified!

951
00:36:40,332 --> 00:36:43,102
For more information on
the Patt Buttrum Fan Club.

952
00:36:43,135 --> 00:36:45,605
This is made out
to Gabby Hayes.

953
00:36:45,638 --> 00:36:48,707
They'll recall the
van back to the factory

954
00:36:48,740 --> 00:36:50,008
in a few weeks anyways.

955
00:36:50,042 --> 00:36:51,710
Olympia Dukakis,
ladies and gentlemen.

956
00:36:51,743 --> 00:36:53,512
(laughter)

957
00:36:54,047 --> 00:36:56,548
(theme music)

958
00:37:01,987 --> 00:37:03,022
Look at this.

959
00:37:03,055 --> 00:37:04,023
They can get,
"All My Children".

960
00:37:04,057 --> 00:37:05,523
(laughing)

961
00:37:05,858 --> 00:37:08,193
It's the Charlene
Tilton channel.

962
00:37:09,062 --> 00:37:10,462
What's the cross for?

963
00:37:10,495 --> 00:37:12,998
A little surprise for
anybody following us.

964
00:37:13,865 --> 00:37:15,200
You see that bazooka?

965
00:37:15,968 --> 00:37:17,035
I like this.

966
00:37:17,068 --> 00:37:18,870
Sometime's a bazooka
is just a bazooka.

967
00:37:18,903 --> 00:37:20,640
This is really nice.

968
00:37:20,673 --> 00:37:21,973
Just push that button,

969
00:37:22,007 --> 00:37:24,177
and whoever was following us,

970
00:37:24,210 --> 00:37:25,878
boom!

971
00:37:25,912 --> 00:37:26,878
Ain't no more.

972
00:37:26,912 --> 00:37:28,447
Plus it's got
neat pop holders.

973
00:37:28,480 --> 00:37:30,482
This is really neat.

974
00:37:30,515 --> 00:37:32,952
I mean, really!

975
00:37:32,985 --> 00:37:35,888
Uh oh, you forgot
the battering ram.

976
00:37:35,922 --> 00:37:37,557
We've gotta bust through the
main gate of the compound.

977
00:37:37,590 --> 00:37:38,823
It's just a big
hotel ice maker.

978
00:37:38,857 --> 00:37:41,060
It's all built in,
3 or 4 inches steel.

979
00:37:41,093 --> 00:37:42,762
She'll take any
gate and a lot more.

980
00:37:42,795 --> 00:37:44,597
We've gotta do one more
thing before we destroy

981
00:37:44,630 --> 00:37:46,098
