982
00:37:46,132 --> 00:37:46,932
Everybody go potty.

983
00:37:46,965 --> 00:37:49,135
Oh no, what did I forget?

984
00:37:49,168 --> 00:37:51,203
We've gotta lay our hands
on some heavy ammunition

985
00:37:51,237 --> 00:37:52,638
to arm this baby.

986
00:37:52,672 --> 00:37:55,007
There's a bunch of
right-wing military fanatics

987
00:37:55,040 --> 00:37:57,108
that headquarter out
in Ventura County.

988
00:37:57,142 --> 00:37:59,878
They've got an organization
called "The American Right".

989
00:37:59,912 --> 00:38:00,780
Headed by Newt Gingrich.

990
00:38:00,813 --> 00:38:02,280
They've got an arsenal there.

991
00:38:02,315 --> 00:38:05,017
They're prepared to
start World War Three.

992
00:38:05,050 --> 00:38:06,385
If we're gonna
steal their guns,

993
00:38:06,418 --> 00:38:07,853
we'd better check it out first.

994
00:38:07,887 --> 00:38:10,022
Like I always tell my students,

995
00:38:10,055 --> 00:38:12,858
"Preparation is
the key to an A+"

996
00:38:12,892 --> 00:38:14,927
I'll go down and snoop
around as a potential member.

997
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:16,828
Eww!

998
00:38:16,862 --> 00:38:18,797
That's not good Elaine,
they might recognize a cop.

999
00:38:18,830 --> 00:38:21,267
Well, how about me?

1000
00:38:21,300 --> 00:38:22,668
I could tell them,

1001
00:38:22,702 --> 00:38:24,170
I wish to make a big donation

1002
00:38:24,203 --> 00:38:25,872
from my poor deceased
husband's estate.

1003
00:38:25,905 --> 00:38:26,805
(sighs)

1004
00:38:26,838 --> 00:38:28,140
I'll shake my bod a little.

1005
00:38:28,173 --> 00:38:30,475
Then we'll get all the
ammunition we need.

1006
00:38:30,508 --> 00:38:32,812
Okay, and to make this work,
I'll go as your chauffeur.

1007
00:38:32,845 --> 00:38:34,980
Just in case
there's any trouble.

1008
00:38:35,013 --> 00:38:35,782
Trouble?

1009
00:38:35,815 --> 00:38:36,848
But we're pretty.

1010
00:38:36,882 --> 00:38:37,983
Do you think there
might be some trouble?

1011
00:38:38,017 --> 00:38:40,018
Oh no, you can handle it.

1012
00:38:40,052 --> 00:38:42,788
Just put the mason brass
knuckles in your purse.

1013
00:38:42,822 --> 00:38:44,190
Can't they just
buy some ammunition?

1014
00:38:44,223 --> 00:38:47,660
Well, I never go
anywhere without them.

1015
00:38:47,693 --> 00:38:48,927
That's mousse.

1016
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:51,030
And we'll be close
by, just in case.

1017
00:38:51,330 --> 00:38:53,332
And I can climb through
a window or something.

1018
00:38:53,365 --> 00:38:54,767
Not that it'll help.

1019
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:55,968
Or you can stand by
the phone in the garage,

1020
00:38:56,002 --> 00:38:57,803
in case of any emergency.

1021
00:38:57,837 --> 00:38:58,803
(laughing)

1022
00:38:58,837 --> 00:39:00,807
I never get to
do any of this stuff.

1023
00:39:00,840 --> 00:39:02,808
Wa-ya-hi-ya!

1024
00:39:02,842 --> 00:39:04,943
(chuckles)

1025
00:39:04,977 --> 00:39:07,513
Hey, it's Glenn
Russell's house.

1026
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:09,682
You and your date
will be chauffeured

1027
00:39:09,715 --> 00:39:11,917
to exotic Centerville,
Minnesota.

1028
00:39:14,018 --> 00:39:16,422
Here comes the Prime
Minister of Greece.

1029
00:39:20,092 --> 00:39:21,927
She must be engaged
to Sean Penn.

1030
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:23,462
(laughs)

1031
00:39:29,768 --> 00:39:31,837
Look at that, Stanley.

1032
00:39:34,973 --> 00:39:36,875
She's getting more
and more Tina Louise-y.

1033
00:39:37,643 --> 00:39:38,643
Wheezy.

1034
00:39:38,677 --> 00:39:40,947
Mrs. Hildago
Campbell, of Houston.

1035
00:39:40,947 --> 00:39:42,848
You were expected,
Mrs. Campbell.

1036
00:39:42,848 --> 00:39:44,350
Step right this way.

1037
00:39:44,350 --> 00:39:46,352
We're going to prom.

1038
00:39:47,185 --> 00:39:48,787
Thank you.

1039
00:39:49,522 --> 00:39:50,823
She's an arachnid.

1040
00:39:50,857 --> 00:39:52,123
Blegh.

1041
00:39:53,325 --> 00:39:55,660
Hired help must wait outside.

1042
00:39:55,693 --> 00:39:57,262
If you don't mind, I'll
go with Mrs. Campbell.

1043
00:39:57,295 --> 00:39:58,763
You better step aside.

1044
00:39:58,797 --> 00:40:00,665
Mmm, mmm, mmm, mmm.

1045
00:40:00,698 --> 00:40:02,067
I've given fair warning.

1046
00:40:02,100 --> 00:40:05,603
Now now, dear,
you'll do as you're told.

1047
00:40:05,637 --> 00:40:07,973
No more, no less.

1048
00:40:08,007 --> 00:40:09,808
Ah yes, yes, yes, yes,

1049
00:40:09,842 --> 00:40:12,410
Uh, welcome, welcome,
Ms. Campbell.

1050
00:40:12,445 --> 00:40:14,113
Delighted to make
your acquaintance.

1051
00:40:14,147 --> 00:40:15,948
